### VeriDoc API — runnable requests
# Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) and JetBrains HTTP Client.
# 1. Set @key to your VERIDOC_API_KEY.
# 2. Run "Create document"; @docId is filled in automatically from its response.
# 3. Run "Process next batch" until status is "ready".

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@key = change-me
@docId = {{create.response.body.id}}

### Health (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create document
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/honojs/hono/main/README.md",
  "fileName": "hono-readme.md"
}

### Process next batch (repeat until "ready")
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{docId}}/process
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Get document
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{docId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### List documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### List only ready documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?limit=10&status=ready
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Delete document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{docId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}


### ---------- Error cases ----------

### 401 — no API key
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents

### 400 — url must be https
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "http://example.com/a.md", "fileName": "a.md" }

### 415 — unsupported file type
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/photo.png", "fileName": "photo.png" }

### 400 — limit out of range
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?limit=500
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### 404 — unknown document
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/000000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
